D 4.50 = SGD 2.25 - charged to the platform and never recovered from the rider.\n\nPOL-NS-04 (RIDER'S EXONERATION CLAIM) - REJECTED. Limb (b) fails: the rider's message went out at 09:20:57 and the driver replied at 09:21:47, 50 seconds later, inside the 120-second window, and no in-app call is recorded. The clause therefore cannot exonerate the rider, whatever her position at the pin.\n\nAMOUNTS. The refund figure is the SGD 4.50 actually charged, per the fare breakdown (EV-FARE-02714, weight 1.0: cancellation_fee 4.50, total_charged 4.50, refund_issued_sgd 0.00), which reconciles with the platform policy in force (cancellation_fee_sgd 4.50) so there is no POL-NS-08(d) defect. The goodwill figure is SGD 2.25.\n\nNO ESCALATION. The GPS, trip and chat artifacts are all complete at weight 1.0 and unimpaired under POL-NS-08(a)-(d). The anti-farming check does not trip (driver no_show_terminations_30d 1 against completed_trips_30d 137 = 0.007, and the count is below 4 in any event). Neither party shows any 90-day cross-disputes, and rider no_show_disputes_30d is 0. Confidence 0.90 is above the 0.70 floor. The missing traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-02714-01 (weight 0.0) carries no fact in this ruling - no party seeks to accumulate dwell across separate in-geofence intervals - so its absence does not cap confidence or change the outcome; the two claims citing it were discarded by the referee for non-disclosure of its issue code.\n\nNO REFERRAL. The arrival marker is not a false one: the driver's closest approach of 272.98 m is inside the 300 m mark and he was stationary, so POL-NS-05 does not fire and produces no false-arrival record. RIDER_NO_SHOW is one of the reason codes POL-NS-01 recognises, so no reason-code education referral arises. POL-NS-07 produces no packet because it is not reached.\n\nPROFILES. The rider's rating, account age, lifetime trips and deviation_claims, and the driver's prior_no_show_flags, are context only under POL-GEN-01 and were not used as grounds of decision.\n\nThe monetary effect is SGD 6.75 (a SGD 4.50 refund plus SGD 2.25 platform-funded goodwill), below the SGD 8.00 automatic-execution threshold."
